OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 12 Oct to Wed 21 Oct
OL,6,FRemaining changeable through the
OL,7,Fmiddle of October, as a series of low
OL,8,Fpressure systems run across the North
OL,9,FAtlantic, often to the north and
OL,10,Fnorthwest of the UK, bringing
OL,11,Foccasional bands of rain and strong
OL,12,Fwinds, but interspersed with brighter
OL,13,Fand more showery conditions. Rain will
OL,14,Fbe most prevalent across hills in the
OL,15,Fwest and especially northwest, where
OL,16,Fabove average rainfall is likely
OL,17,Fthrough this period. Longer drier
OL,18,Finterludes are more favoured in
OL,19,Fsheltered southern and eastern parts,
OL,20,Fbut even here it is likely to be
OL,21,Fwetter than during recent weeks.
OL,22,FWhilst brief cooler interludes are
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fpossible, temperatures are likely to
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fbe a little above average in many
OL,25,Fareas for the period as a whole,
OL,26,Fpotentially quite warm in parts of the
